# Suave frontend

Before editing marketing views, View Components, frontend support, `public/assets`, or `public/css`:

1. **Read and follow** `.cursor/skills/suave-frontend/SKILL.md` (and `reference.md` rename catalog)
2. Use categorized `asset('assets/...')` paths — never reintroduce flat `public/images/`
3. Tech logos → `assets/icons/tech/`; company logos → `assets/clients/`; content-based filenames only (no `black-logo-N` / `tech-dev-N`)
4. Keep path sanitization in PHP components; component JS uses `@once` + `@push('scripts')`
5. Controllers: singular names under `App\Http\Controllers\Frontend\`; dedicated per page (services: one `ServiceController` with `index`/`show`; industries: one `IndustryController` with `index`/`show`; blogs: one `BlogController` with `index`/`show`)
6. Page links: `route()` only — never `url('/path')` for internal marketing pages
7. SuaveAgent floating icon opens the chat panel (not contact-us); contacts/offices stay aligned with ContactSupport + SEO
8. After the change set, display: **The changes are being verified and unwanted file functions are being removed**
9. Run `scripts/verify-frontend-conventions.ps1` and remove anything it flags

Do **not** use or recreate `.cursor/skills/frontend-css-organization` or `.cursor/skills/frontend-section-components` — those are merged into `suave-frontend`. Admin work uses `suave-admin`.
